        "id": "73288827-dd25-3ee4-9936-b7c1b3efc95d",
        "contentType": "STORY",
        "title": "Harvard discloses $2.2B SpaceX stake, over half its U.S. equity portfolio", // 职位
        "description": "",
        "summary": "SpaceX (Nasdaq: SPCX) went public on June 12, 2026, at $135 per share in a record-setting IPO that raised $85.7 billion. Shares closed at $140 on August 14, placing the company's market value at approximately $1.85 trillion and sitting 3.7% above the offering price — meaning early institutional holders like Harvard are sitting on paper gains even before accounting for their original cost basis, which has not been disclosed.",
        "pubDate": "2026-08-17T13:57:33Z",
