        "title": "SpaceX Stock, Recovering From Post-IPO Slump, Rises Ahead of Another Share Unlock", // 职位
        "description": "",
        "summary": "SpaceX  stock rose on Monday ahead of another tranche of stock being unlocked to trade.  Shares of Elon Musk’s rocket and artificial-intelligence company were up 4.3% at $146.08 in early trading.  SpaceX  sold about 556 million new shares to the public in early June, raising about $75 billion (excluding the broker’s overallotment option), which was a small fraction of the roughly 13.2 billion shares outstanding.",
